{"id":210665264,"slug":"ramht-psych-congress-september-14th","title":"RAMHT New Orleans September 14th, 2026!","subtitle":"Join us! An announcement for a good time.","post_date":"2026-08-12T14:39:22.452Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/ramht-psych-congress-september-14th","wordcount":396,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:43:27.076Z","body_sha256":"f0a6147a9fe45034cd36599a53f1f96a2770a7f59d264ae8edca071fbbf56c24","text_words":445,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p><span>I have some very exciting news to share: </span><a href=\"https://www.rapidmentalhealth.com/\"><span>RAMHT</span></a><span> is expanding our event calendar and will be </span><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-psych-congress-2026-tickets-1990879180221\"><span>bringing the show</span></a><span> to New Orleans on September 14</span><sup><span>th</span></sup><span>!</span></p><p><span>Our theme — </span><strong><span>Building the Practice of Tomorrow, Today</span></strong><span> — reflects our ongoing efforts to transform the future of brain medicine, accelerate access to innovative mental health treatments, and foster a community of experts and advocates dedicated to improving lives.</span></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GBem!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GBem!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GBem!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GBem!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GBem!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GBem!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"548\" height=\"411\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:768,&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:548,&quot;bytes&quot;:145239,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/i/210665264?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GBem!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GBem!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GBem!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!GBem!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F381d7678-54c3-4e56-a402-8ac9b99b5151_1024x768.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Ok, this is Rush at MSG, not RAMHT, but it’s pretty close.</figcaption></figure></div><p><span>Led by me, </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/owen-muir-md-dfaacap-fctmss-53345b7/\"><span>Dr. Owen Muir</span></a><span>, and my team mate in life, </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/carlene-macmillan-md-fctmss-dfaacap-5a9a352a/\"><span>Dr. Carlene MacMillan</span></a><span>, of this very </span><em><a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/\"><span>The Frontier Psychiatrists </span></a></em><a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/\"><span>Substack</span></a><em><span> – </span></em><span>along with </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/gradyhannah/\"><span>Grady Hannah</span></a><span>, Co-Founder of </span><a href=\"https://nightware.com/\"><span>NightWare</span></a><span> and RAMHT – the event aims to connect audiences with the leaders shaping the future of psychiatry through:</span></p><ul><li><p><em><span>Rapid-fire 1:1 talks daring to ask the big questions and address the elephants in the room.</span></em></p></li><li><p><em><span>Conversations focused on where interventional psychiatry is heading and how scientific discovery is being translated into real-world impact.</span></em></p></li></ul><p><span>If you’re a nurse practitioner, psychiatrist, psychologist, researcher, resident or advocate, stop sitting through the usual, dry panels!</span></p><p><span>Join us for an engaging evening of discussions focused on breakthroughs in mental health care that are guaranteed to be both entertaining and impactful.</span></p><p><span>Speakers who’ll help us explore a range of advancements in rapid acting mental health treatments include:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jessica-malbergphd/?skipRedirect=true\"><span>Jessica Malberg, PhD</span></a></strong><span>, Executive Director, Medical Affairs, </span><a href=\"https://definiumtx.com/\"><span>Definium Therapeutics</span></a></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/colleen-hanlon/\"><span>Colleen Hanlon, PhD</span></a></strong><span>, VP of Global Medical Affairs, </span><a href=\"https://www.brainsway.com/\"><span>BrainsWay</span></a></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrew-penn-rn-np-cns-pmhnp-bc/\"><span>Andrew Penn, RN, NP, CNS, PMHNP-BC</span></a></strong><span>, Director of Clinical Nursing Operations, </span><a href=\"https://www.salmahealth.com/\"><span>Salma Health</span></a></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/katiepassanisimba/\"><span>Kate Passanisi, MBA</span></a></strong><span>, Managing Director, </span><a href=\"https://carenetgpo.com/\"><span>CareNetGPO</span></a></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tobias-marton-md-phd-4a500923/\"><span>Tobias Marton, MD, PhD</span></a></strong><span>, Chief Medical Officer, </span><a href=\"http://www.mindfulhealthsolutions.com/\"><span>Mindful Health Solutions</span></a></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/steve-beller-b6b54910/\"><span>Steve Beller</span></a></strong><span>, Chief Commercial Officer, </span><a href=\"https://www.neurolief.com/\"><span>Neurorelief</span></a></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kazutaka-okuda-md/\"><span>Kazu Okuda MD</span></a></strong><span>, Founder &amp; CEO, </span><a href=\"https://universal-brain.com/\"><span>Universal Brain</span></a></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jay-pathmanathan-10b785212/\"><span>Jay Pathmanathan MD, PhD</span></a></strong><span>, Medical Director, </span><a href=\"http://beacon.bio/\"><span>Beacon Biosignals</span></a></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/prantik-kundu-5561586/\"><span>Prantik Kundu, PhD</span></a></strong><span>, Co-Founder &amp; CEO, </span><a href=\"https://eyethree.ai/\"><span>EyeThree</span></a></p></li></ul><p><span>And many thanks to our sponsors </span><a href=\"https://definiumtx.com/\"><span>Definium Therapeutics</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.brainsway.com/\"><span>BrainsWay</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://universal-brain.com/\"><span>Universal Brain</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.meetradial.com/\"><span>Radial</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.salmahealth.com/\"><span>Salma Health</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.neurolief.com/\"><span>Neurolief</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.mdhub.ai/\"><span>mdhub</span></a><span>.  Not only are they working tirelessly to transform the future of brain medicine, but they are instrumental partners in making RAMHT possible as a live forum.</span></p><p><span>So,</span><strong><span> block your calendar for September 14</span><sup><span>th</span></sup><span> </span></strong><span>and grab your </span><em><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-psych-congress-2026-tickets-1990879180221\"><span>FREE ticket</span></a></em><span> via Eventbrite!</span></p><p><span>We’ll be sharing more details on speakers, rapid-fire talks and panel discussions on the RAMHT </span><a href=\"https://www.rapidmentalhealth.com/\"><span>website</span></a><span> and </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/rapidmentalhealth/?viewAsMember=true\"><span>LinkedIn</span></a><span> page (follow us if you’re not!).</span></p><p><span>Stay tuned, get excited for more &amp; see you in New Orleans!  Also, we will have special guests.  And surprises.  And maybe….just maybe…</span><em><span>embarrassing merch, for me, personally.</span></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-psych-congress-2026-tickets-1990879180221&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Get your FREE RAMHT Tickets&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-psych-congress-2026-tickets-1990879180221\"><span>Get your FREE RAMHT Tickets</span></a></p><p>Prior RAMHT-themed content includes:</p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;f7822579-db63-4066-9052-4cc3cd3555f8&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;The Frontier Psychiatrists is a newsletter and a stealth media empire. We have—that was the royal we—grown into a movement with our first in-person event coming up this Sunday. YES. In San Francisco! This Sunday, Jan 7th! 6-9 pm.&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:null,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;md&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Rapid Acting Mental Health Treatment is Here...Are You Ready?&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:2277375,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Owen Scott Muir, M.D.&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Dr. Owen Scott Muir, M.D., DFAACAP is the Chief Medical Officer of Radial &amp; Neurolief. He's a graduate of Amherst College, Child, Adolescent, and Adult Psychiatrist, and a prolific writer and podcaster. https://www.meetradial.com for more.&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1c03f44d-4506-4843-989f-0d38e66c6946_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:100}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2024-01-03T03:26:44.730Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&